# Template for quiz/questions.jsonl. Copy this file to quiz/questions.jsonl and add your own questions.
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored. One JSON object per line, all six fields required:
#   id        short unique name
#   q         the question, asked of the brain
#   gold      the correct answer, one or two sentences
#   facts     list of 2-4 key facts a right answer must contain
#   cites     list of repo-relative pages the gold answer came from
#   verified  YYYY-MM-DD, the day you last checked the gold against those pages
# A page whose frontmatter `updated:` is later than `verified` flags the gold for a recheck.
# Fake placeholder (a comment, not a question):
# {"id": "example-1", "q": "What colour is the shop door?", "gold": "Blue.", "facts": ["blue"], "cites": ["wiki/projects/example.md"], "verified": "2026-01-01"}
